<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-11213]  A number of suites failed because of maven-surefire-plugin NPE for Java 11 build</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-11213</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;See, for example, Logging Run Config failure at &lt;a href=&quot;https://ci.ignite.apache.org/viewLog.html?tab=buildLog&amp;amp;logTab=tree&amp;amp;filter=debug&amp;amp;expand=all&amp;amp;buildId=2996808&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://ci.ignite.apache.org/viewLog.html?tab=buildLog&amp;amp;logTab=tree&amp;amp;filter=debug&amp;amp;expand=all&amp;amp;buildId=2996808&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;preformatted panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;preformattedContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;test (default-cli) on project ignite-core: Execution default-cli of goal org.apache.maven.plugins:maven-surefire-plugin:2.20.1:test failed. NullPointerException -&amp;gt; [Help 1]
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;According &lt;a href=&quot;https://maven.apache.org/surefire/maven-surefire-plugin/&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://maven.apache.org/surefire/maven-surefire-plugin/&lt;/a&gt; at least &lt;a href=&quot;https://mvnrepository.com/artifact/org.apache.maven.plugins/maven-surefire-plugin/3.0.0-M3&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://mvnrepository.com/artifact/org.apache.maven.plugins/maven-surefire-plugin/3.0.0-M3&lt;/a&gt; is required&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
